      CHECK 08-new-helper-placement-defended: PASS (suite detected the mutation)
      CHECK 09-encrypt-failure-reporting-defended: PASS (suite detected the mutation)
      CHECK 10-atomicwrite-failure-reporting-defended: PASS (suite detected the mutation)
      CHECK 05-build: PASS
      CHECK 06-vet: PASS
